OL,3,AArrested generals and a threatened VP:
OL,4,APresident's son fuels Ugandan
OL,5,Asuccession fever
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Uganda's military, even senior
OL,8,Fgenerals are finding that their rank
OL,9,Foffers little protection from the wrath
OL,10,Fof the country's powerful army chief.
OL,12,FOver the past 15 months, at least a
OL,13,Fdozen generals and senior officers have
OL,14,Fbeen arrested under Gen Muhoozi
OL,15,FKainerugaba, who is also the son of
OL,16,FPresident Yoweri Museveni, in a
OL,17,Fcrackdown that has unsettled the
OL,18,Fmilitary's top ranks.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
