OL,3,AArrested generals and a threatened VP:
OL,4,APresident's son fuels Ugandan
OL,5,Asuccession fever
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe arrests come amid growing political
OL,8,Ftensions over who will succeed
OL,9,FMuseveni, who has ruled Uganda for four
OL,10,Fdecades.
OL,12,FGen Kainerugaba, 52, is widely seen as
OL,13,Fa potential successor, although his
OL,14,Fambitions appear to be facing
OL,15,Fresistance within the ruling party.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
